# CUP, CUU, CUB — ECMA-48 §8.3.21 (CUP), §8.3.22 (CUU), §8.3.18 (CUB).
# Parameters are one-based on the wire: ESC[3;5H is row 3 column 5, which is
# row 2 column 4 here. An omitted parameter takes the sequence's default,
# which is 1 for all of these.
# Movement stops at the edges of the screen; ESC[99;99H on a 4x10 screen is
# the bottom right cell, not an error.
\e[3;5Hx
\e[Ay
\e[2Dz
\e[Hq
\e[99;99H*
\e[1;2H
